    <PackageReleaseNotes>v6.5.0: 2026 model refresh + provider API-contract fixes. New models — OpenAI gpt-5.5 / gpt-5.5-pro (+ dated snapshots) / gpt-5-pro, Anthropic claude-opus-4-8 / claude-opus-4-7, Google gemini-3.1-pro-preview / gemini-3.5-flash / gemini-3.1-flash-lite, xAI grok-4.3 / grok-4.20 (reasoning, non-reasoning) / grok-build-0.1, Perplexity sonar-reasoning-pro; plus WithGpt5_5Parameters for GPT-5.5 reasoning effort/verbosity. Fixes: Anthropic Opus 4.7/4.8 omit unsupported temperature and use adaptive thinking (thinking.type=adaptive + output_config.effort) instead of the rejected budget_tokens form; OpenAI gpt-5-pro is sent the only-supported high effort and gpt-5.2/5.4/5.5-pro clamp none/low to medium; OpenAI image generation moves off the retired dall-e-3 to gpt-image-1 (drops response_format; GenerateImageUrlAsync returns a base64 data: URI); request timeout is unified to a single control point (FunctionCallingPolicy timeout authoritative, no longer capped by HttpClient.Timeout, 300s default for slow pro models); xAI grok-build omits unsupported frequency/presence penalties; Google Gemini 3 pro uses Low (not MINIMAL) thinking when reasoning is disabled. Default models updated to current flagships (Anthropic claude-sonnet-4-6, xAI grok-4.3, Google gemini-3.1-pro-preview). Removed retired/incompatible model constants: grok-3, grok-4-0709, grok-4-1-fast, grok-4.20-multi-agent-0309, claude-sonnet-4-20250514, sonar-reasoning, gemini-3-pro-preview, gpt-5.3-codex-spark — these reference models that no longer function. Requires Mythosia.AI.Abstractions v2.3.0.</PackageReleaseNotes>
